# The call of the demo case, backed up before any run: the call itself, in the form
# that can be run again, and it already carries what it answered. A run handed this
# directory as its call backup replays the 5 instead of measuring again.
value =
    $call (__dyn_call__ << "measure_distance" << (
        $victim ($x 0 * $y 0)
      * $suspect ($x 3 * $y 4)
      * $at "12:30"
    ))
  * $result 5
